  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "からだから　はなつ　よいかおりがこむぎの　せいちょうを　たすけるためのうそんで　たいせつにされてきた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "몸에서 나는 좋은 향기가 밀의 성장을 돕기 때문에 농촌에서 소중히 여겨진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身體散發出的迷人香氣能有助於小麥的成長，因此一直都備受農村人家的珍視。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est très apprécié depuis longtemps dans les villages agricoles, car le délicieux parfum qu’il dégage aide à faire croître le blé.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Da der wohlige Duft, den sein Körper verströmt, das Wachstum von Weizen begünstigt, schätzt man dieses Pokémon in Bauerndörfern sehr.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El fragante aroma que despide su cuerpo favorece el crecimiento del trigo, por lo que lo aprecian mucho en las comunidades agrícolas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le comunità agricole lo tengono da tempo in gran considerazione, poiché il buon profumo che emana favorisce la crescita del grano.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The pleasant aroma that emanates from this Pokémon’s body helps wheat grow, so Dachsbun has been treasured by farming villages.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体から　放つ　良い香りが小麦の　成長を　助けるため農村で　大切にされてきた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "身体散发出的迷人香气有助于小麦的成长，因此在农村一直备受重视。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "El fragante aroma que despide su cuerpo favorece el crecimiento del trigo, por lo que lo aprecian mucho en las comunidades agrícolas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひふの　ひょうめんは　つよい　ねつをうけると　かたくなる　せいしつ。からだは　こうばしい　においがする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "피부 표면은 뜨거운 열을 받으면 딱딱해지는 성질을 가졌다. 몸에서 구수한 냄새가 난다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "牠的皮膚的表面擁有著遇到高溫就會變硬的性質。身體聞起來香噴噴的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La surface de sa peau durcit lorsqu’elle est exposée à une forte chaleur. Son corps exhale un délicieux parfum.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Die Oberfläche seiner Haut erhärtet, wenn sie starker Hitze ausgesetzt wird. Der Körper dieses Pokémon duftet herrlich.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La superficie de su piel se endurece cuando se expone a un calor intenso. Su cuerpo desprende un fragante aroma.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La superficie della sua pelle ha la proprietà di indurirsi se esposta ad alte temperature. Il suo corpo emana una fragranza deliziosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The surface of this Pokémon’s skin hardens when exposed to intense heat, and its body has an appetizing aroma.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "皮膚の　表面は　強い　熱を受けると　硬くなる　性質。体は　香ばしい　匂いがする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "它的皮肤表面拥有遇到高温就变硬的性质。身体散发着香香的气味。",
      "language": {
